In Perl, the code might be written as follows:

```perl
#!/usr/bin/perl 
# Import the List::Util library to calculate sum
use List::Util qw(sum);

# Express meanAbsoluteDeviation as a subroutine in perl
sub meanAbsoluteDeviation {
    my @numbers = @_;

    # Calculate the mean
    my $mean = sum(@numbers) / @numbers;

    # Calculate the absolute deviations from the mean
    my @deviations = map { abs($_ - $mean) } @numbers;

    # Return the mean of the absolute deviations
    return sum(@deviations) / @deviations;
}

